# The document engine is source-byte authoritative and the plan 0009
# evidence chain hashes whole files: a checkout must reproduce the
# committed bytes exactly on every platform, so git must never apply
# end-of-line conversion in either direction. The Windows platform leg
# proved the failure mode: runner-default autocrlf produced CRLF
# working trees that broke byte-exact anchors and line probes.
* -text
